        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: Supernatural: Bloodlines, Supernatural season 13\n- Products: Supernatural\n- People: Eric Kripke\n- Organizations: The CW\n\nFacts:\n- Supernatural: Bloodlines was planned as a spin-off of Supernatural.\n- The twentieth episode of Supernatural's ninth season was intended to serve as the backdoor pilot for Supernatural: Bloodlines.\n- Eric Kripke created Supernatural, an American fantasy horror television series.\n- Supernatural season 13 was scheduled to premiere on October 12, 2017, on The CW.",
